      <TextObject Name="Text14" Top="141.75" Width="408.45" Height="105.3" Text="1. Physical &amp; liquid damage is not included in the warranty.&#13;&#10;2. Battery &amp; adapter are not included in the warranty.&#13;&#10;3. Screen damage, lines, or spots on the screen are not included in &#13;&#10;    the warranty.&#13;&#10;4. Under service warranty, the customer must pay for spare parts &#13;&#10;    cost if any, service or repair charges will be free.&#13;&#10;" Font="Times New Roman, 11pt"/>
